, \"I'm going to take you to hear Sidney Bechet. \" At that time in Paris, there was a huge gap between dixieland and modern jazz. I said, \"I don't want to hear Sidney Bechet. He's, like, of the old school. \" She said, \"Don't say things like that unless you really know. I want to take you to hear him. \" We went, and ...", "type": "string"}, "datatype": "string"}, "type": "statement", "id": "Q15981$EC6D0D2D-0188-4538-87AB-780DFEA58186", "rank": "normal"}], "P20": [{"mainsnak": {"snaktype": "value", "property": "P20", "hash": "a7a2e4a06715ba248cc7bec146ee938fcedaefa5", "datavalue": {"value": "https://semlab.s3.amazonaws.com/texts/8953648b4a619bcff882195a7961ffb0/97.txt", "type": "string"}, "datatype": "url"}, "type": "statement", "id": "Q15981$1ABF617D-9AAD-4020-868A-65659D0F317F", "rank": "normal"}], "P21": [{"mainsnak": {"snaktype": "value", "property": "P21", "hash": "802e1ee185e177cc122d16c1dc100b860f19f6c0", "datavalue": {"value": {"entity-type": "item", "numeric-id": 222, "id": "Q222"}, "type": "wikibase-entityid"}, "datatype": "wikibase-item"}, "type": "statement", "id": "Q15981$E99F9D85-E57C-4958-A935-69C5F92FA7FE", "rank": "normal"}, {"mainsnak": {"snaktype": "value", "property": "P21", "hash": "0eda4d197e3bac737f51845950e942a6f8110ea8", "datavalue": {"value": {"entity-type": "item", "numeric-id": 314, "id": "Q314"}, "type": "wikibase-entityid"}, "datatype": "wikibase-item"}, "type": "statement", "id": "Q15981$D751FA27-A04E-48EB-9A1A-B4BC8F0EC9C4", "rank": "normal"}], "P22": [{"mainsnak": {"snaktype": "value", "property": "P22", "hash": "8e0abffddec0903ecca01af48d389b0fbf3384ab", "datavalue": {"value": {"entity-type": "item", "numeric-id": 1772, "id": "Q1772"}, "type": "wikibase-entityid"}, "datatype": "wikibase-item"}, "type": "statement", "id": "Q15981$C562560A-E348-4050-AD77-8B343F1C986D", "rank": "normal"}], "P23": [{"mainsnak": {"snaktype": "value", "property": "P23", "hash": "25176b513f2f538153e5cdca588409932451f34f", "datavalue": {"value": {"entity